Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: autopch
Architecture: any
Depends:
    ${shlibs:Depends},
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: Cluster headers into balanced PCH sets for C/C++ builds
 autopch analyzes a set of C or C++ sources, builds a co-occurrence graph of
 included headers, and emits one or more precompiled-header clusters so large
 projects can avoid a single oversized PCH without scattering tiny ones.
